ditions under which government-backed security should be provided. It does not directly relate to the burden of cost on depositors.\n\nGiven the analysis, option B is the most relevant and directly supports the conclusion that depositors should bear the cost of the insurance because they benefit from it.\n</think>\n<answer>\nB\n</answer>",
