ven information. The average salaries do not provide any direct comparison between the number of dieticians and physical therapists. We only know the average salaries, not the exact number of employees in each category.\n\nAfter analyzing each option, the only conclusion that can be properly drawn based on the given information is Option B.\n</think>\n<answer>\nB\n</answer>",
