tions, which aligns with the definition of intellectual property.\n\n3. **Conclusion**: Based on the analysis, the option that does not fit the definition of intellectual property is C) Portrait rights.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:\n</think>\n<answer>C</answer>",
